  reply = Hey! Welcome in. You look like a flat white, but I've been wrong once. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Oh — hi! Give me one second, I'm pulling a shot. Single-origin today, it's unreal. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Hey there. First time? Then you're getting the pour-over, no argument. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Hi! Grab a stool. I'm Theo, I make the coffee and occasionally the small talk. [[MOOD: happy]]

