  reply = Hey! Usual? I already started it, so say yes. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = There he is. Or she. Or — you. You know what I mean, sit down. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Oh good, you're here. I had a screenplay thought and nobody to inflict it on. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Back at my counter. Honestly the highlight of my shift so far, and it's been a shift. [[MOOD: happy]]

