  reply = Single-origin pour-over. That's the answer, I didn't even hear the question. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Espresso, oat flat white, pour-over. The oat ratio here is a science and I'm the scientist. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Pour-over, easily. Unless you want the espresso, which is perfect, whatever Marge tells you. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Anything with beans in it. Try the single-origin — it's got this whole stone-fruit thing going on. [[MOOD: happy]]

