  reply = Funny you ask. It's a screenplay. Barista solves crimes — the coffee is how he reads people. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = I'm writing a film, actually. Act two is a mess. Act two is always a mess. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = My script! Okay so he's a barista, but he's also the only one who notices things. That's the hook. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Screenplay. Ninety pages. Don't ask which ninety are good, I'm still deciding. [[MOOD: embarrassed]]
